      "source": [
        "# Taller 07: clasificadores KNN y RNN con `digits`\n",
        "\n",
        "**Inteligencia Artificial - ELP 8012 - Universidad del Norte**\n",
        "**Programa de Ingeniería de Sistemas — Profesor: Eduardo Zurek, Ph.D.**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Integrantes:**\n",
        "- Andrew Quintero\n",
        "- *Willimer Santiago*\n",
        "- *Bryan Montoya*\n",
        "\n",
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "ItepeNicYtkc",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ItepeNicYtkc"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Metodología\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Se carga el conjunto `digits`, que contiene imágenes de 8 × 8 píxeles y diez clases, de 0 a 9.\n",
        "2. Se separa una muestra estratificada: 80 % para entrenamiento y 20 % para prueba.\n",
        "3. Se estandarizan las características. El escalador se ajusta dentro de cada partición de validación para evitar fuga de información.\n",
        "4. Se prueban varios valores de `K` y de `R` usando `StratifiedKFold(n_splits=4)`.\n",
        "5. Se selecciona el hiperparámetro con mayor F1 macro promedio. Esta métrica da el mismo peso a todos los dígitos.\n",
        "6. Finalmente, cada modelo se ajusta con todo el entrenamiento y se evalúa una sola vez con la prueba reservada."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "4wGE5kRVYtke",
      "metadata": {
        "execution": {
          "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-25T02:11:27.110796Z",
          "iopub.status.busy": "2026-09-25T02:11:27.110657Z",
          "iopub.status.idle": "2026-09-25T02:11:28.751309Z",
          "shell.execute_reply": "2026-09-25T02:11:28.750198Z"
        },
        "id": "4wGE5kRVYtke"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "\n",
        "from sklearn.base import clone\n",
        "from sklearn.datasets import load_digits\n",
        "from sklearn.metrics import (accuracy_score, balanced_accuracy_score,\n",
        "                             classification_report, cohen_kappa_score,\n",
        "                             confusion_matrix, f1_score, log_loss,\n",
        "                             roc_auc_score, ConfusionMatrixDisplay)\n",
        "from sklearn.model_selection import StratifiedKFold, train_test_split\n",
        "from sklearn.neighbors import KNeighborsClassifier, RadiusNeighborsClassifier\n",
        "from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\n",
        "from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler, label_binarize\n",
        "\n",
        "SEED = 1970\n",
        "np.random.seed(SEED)\n",
        "plt.rcParams['figure.figsize'] = (9, 5)\n",
        "plt.rcParams['axes.grid'] = True\n",
        "plt.rcParams['grid.alpha'] = 0.25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "Y71CeIsqYtki",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Y71CeIsqYtki"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 1. Carga y exploración del dataset"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
